{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "PiCrawler \u2014 Perceptual CPG \u00b7 Trot + SynergyTimer (Phase 7.9 arm S)",
    "description": "Phase 7.5 perceptual-CPG variant G2: trot gait pattern (FL+RR in phase=0, FR+RL in phase=\u03c0) at period_ticks=60 (~1.0 sim sec).  Most common quadruped running gait \u2014 diagonal pairs lift together for balance.  Tests whether the gait family encoded in the phase relationships matters or only the rhythm itself.\n\nWHAT TO LOOK FOR:\n  \u2022 Same standing baseline as G1.\n  \u2022 Different gait structure if brain latches on: FL+RR should move together, FR+RL together (diagonal-pair coordination).\n  \u2022 Compare body translation to G1 (lateral-seq) \u2014 if trot is better suited to picrawler's mass distribution, this could outperform.\n  \u2022 Fall rate comparable to G1.\n\nPhase 7.5.R+ \u2014 adds epm_radial_compass clustering the 2-D body-frame outward-direction vector (reality.proprio.radial_compass).  Diagnosed gap from G2_trot+gated UI observation: brain found a gait but motion was directionally random (median |v|=0.05 m/s; only 7 mm/s net outward; only 1/6 bursts efficiently outward).  Radial-compass gives egocentric goal vector so brain has a sensor for \"which way is outward\" instead of learning navigation purely from delayed reward.\n\nPhase 7.9 variant S: SynergyTimer pre-softmax logit bias on top of lean trot baseline.  Per-leg touchdown detection from reality.proprio.feet_y; per-(Premotor, phase_bin, intent) synergy table B learned via reward-gated Hebbian; per-tick bias output = rhythm_bias_gain \u00d7 confidence \u00d7 B[phase_bin, :].  Default rhythm_bias_gain=0.3 (mid-range; tune at Stage 2 if too aggressive).  Composes additively with W (REINFORCE).",
    "env_target": "picrawler",
    "phase_tag": "v6.17b + compass + perceptual-cpg trot (Phase 7.5 arm G2)",
    "derived_from_manifest": true,
    "episode_length": 6000,
    "mc_episode_period": 1500,
    "stability_gain": 0.05,
    "stability_y_norm": 0.5,
    "stability_speed": 0.05,
    "reward_shape": "trapezoid",
    "target_height": 0.085,
    "height_penalty_grace": 0.02,
    "height_penalty_scale": 0.03,
    "height_penalty_gain": 0.05,
    "leg_symmetry": "lr_pairs"
  },
  "version": 1,
  "runtime": {
    "thread_pool": "per_instance",
    "num_threads": 0
  },
